  "body": "The prior Cg candidate compiled but failed the selected layout offsets. This adds a separately qualified Eigen 3.4.0 header input, a measured compile-only builder, an inert parent-object/literal descriptor, and independent static/report acceptance under a new one-use workflow. Existing consumed sources, images, requests and historical outcomes stay unchanged.\n\nValidation: 1796 local cases, 1789 passed and 7 skipped, including the separately measured spacious-filesystem capacity case. One independent wholebranch review found three Important issues; all were fixed with RED\u2192GREEN tests and the full suite. The remaining Minor is trailing PLT padding validation; the supported jump prefix, relocation and named import are checked. Report coherence is independently checked; remote host measurements are not remeasured locally.\n\nThe authorized single hosted compile-only build is pending exact-source CI. No generated target, SDK, Panda, GL, Xvfb, model or official ORT execution, installation, image publication or merge is authorized. Selected static success would not establish full ABI, runtime admission or prior SIGABRT repair. Scientific allowance remains 0; strict 0/4 FAIL; Stage7 INCOMPLETE.\n",
